            "paragraph": "To design sensitivity experiments which disaggregate the temporal correlation between climate and atmospheric CO2 levels, we used the methodology developed in Haas et al. and summarised below. We obtained modern and future vegetation (tree, shrub, grass) and GPP using the coupled biogeography and biogeochemistry model BIOME4 and a simple optimality-based model of GPP, the P Model. BIOME4 simulates biome distribution given a set of climates (temperature, precipitation, cloud cover) and CO2 conditions and outputs biome classification, fraction of C4 photosynthesis and leaf area index (LAI).",
